                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Short and Sweet. The music is relaxing and even on a loop I never found it annoying. There aren't any moments of frustration which I have found in many platformers. The art is pleasant to look at and the light humor will put a grin on your face as you move through the game.\n\nI would say at it's price it is definately worth it. I look at it this way, this relaxing experience cost me less than what I pay for coffee daily. I'd say this is a perfect game for if you are dealing with a lot of stress and just need a quick game to calm you down. Great Job, I love it.",
